{#
/**
 * @file
 * Hill Memorial isometric floor map (inline SVG, 1 user unit = 1px of the
 * 4489x3801 draft). Floor 2 is drawn above Floor 1.
 *
 * Variables:
 *   uid    - unique prefix for ids (mask, title, tooltip sources).
 *   spaces - region key => { title, access, url, tip } built by
 *            paragraph--building-map.html.twig. A region renders only when
 *            its key is present: as a link when the space has one, otherwise
 *            as a focusable group that still shows its tooltip.
 *
 * Labels are plain, selectable <text>. Each carries only its position
 * (--x / --y, in map units); rotate and skew are applied in
 * _building-map.scss to suggest the 3D perspective (the font stays upright):
 *   room names:  rotate(-25deg) skewX(-25deg)  (--pf-map-skew-room)
 *   floor names: rotate(-25deg) skewX(35deg)   (--pf-map-skew-floor, also the restroom tiles)
 * data-map-label ties a name to its region so it turns gold on hover.
 *
 * The hatch mask has black cuts where two hatched areas meet so they read as
 * separate rooms. The Floor 2 railing is outline only (dashed back edges,
 * heavier front rail) and hovers with the Floor 2 gallery.
 */
#}
